{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhou-plan","title":"周瑜陈说拒曹之策","order":9592,"accounts":[{"id":"zhou-plan-account-1","label":"记载","text":"周瑜请率精兵进住夏口；孙权赞同迎击曹操。","evidence":["zhou-advice","sun-decision"]},{"id":"zhouyu-a-o010-reasoning","label":null,"text":"周瑜从北土未安、马韩后患、水战不习及寒疾等方面论拒曹之利。","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o010-reasoning"]},{"id":"zhouyu-a-p007-priority","label":"裴松之论","text":"裴松之认为拒曹本谋始鲁肃，周瑜自鄱阳还与肃暗同，批评本传攘肃之善。","evidence":["zhouyu-q-p007-priority"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhou-yu","role":"陈说进军方案","evidence":["zhou-advice"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"赞同迎击","evidence":["sun-decision"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"拟迎击对象","evidence":["allied-zhou","zhou-advice"]}],"place":{"text":"夏口（拟进军地点）","evidence":["zhou-advice"]},"time":{"label":"建安十三年（208）","year":208,"precision":"year","basis":"年次承接本篇建安十三年记事，现代注释释为公元 208 年；此条未记具体月日。","evidence":["year-original","year-modern","zhou-year","zhou-year-modern","zhou-advice","sun-decision"]}}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhou-yu","name":"周瑜","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"allied-zhou","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-df9e8a2d1c2855c608f2","quote":"权遂遣瑜及程普等，与备并力逆曹公，遇于赤壁。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":41,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sun-decision","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-ce104dcfbe59e8754c6b","quote":"君言当击，甚与孤合，此天以君授孤也！","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":59,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"year-modern","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-888495d8be7766faf20c","quote":"十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","layer":"modern","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":666,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0bae348fdb687025113d","start":3,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"year-original","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4bcffcc4ee709a4e5ea3","quote":"十三年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。","layer":"original","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":661,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhou-advice","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-bacde9135abd2a205a56","quote":"瑜请得精兵三万人，进住夏口，保为将军破之！","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":276,"end":297,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhou-year","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3661896c106f1817bf4b","quote":"十三年春〖6〗，权讨江夏，瑜为前部大督〖7〗。其年九月，曹公入荆州，刘琮举众降。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhou-year-modern","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","quote":"十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","layer":"modern","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8f109f42647e5ee8d831","start":3,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o010-reasoning","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-bacde9135abd2a205a56","layer":"original","quote":"瑜曰：“不然！操虽托名汉相，其实汉贼也！将军以神武雄才，兼仗父兄之烈〖11〗；割据江东，地方数千里；兵精足用，英雄乐业。尚当横行天下，为汉家除残去秽；况操自送死，而可迎之邪？请为将军筹之：今使北土已安〖12〗，操无内忧；能旷日持久，来争疆埸；又能与我较胜负于船楫〖13〗，（可乎）〔可也〕〖14〗。今北土既未平安；加马超、韩遂尚在关西〖15〗，为操后患；且舍鞍马，仗舟楫，与吴、越争衡〖16〗，本非中国所长〖17〗；又今盛寒，马无稿草〖18〗；驱中国士众远涉江湖之间，不习水土，必生疾病。此数四者〖19〗，用兵之患也，而操皆冒行之。将军擒操，宜在今日。瑜请得精兵三万人，进住夏口，保为将军破之！”","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":298,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-p007-priority","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-693763015f3a5c900fb2","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以为：建计拒曹公，实始鲁肃。于时周瑜使鄱阳，肃劝权呼瑜；瑜使鄱阳还，但与肃暗同，故能共成大勋。本传直云，权延见群下，问以计策，瑜摆拨众人之议，独言抗拒之计；了不云肃先有谋，殆为攘肃之善也。","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-19fd8eb85b7b2ca85f96","start":315,"end":412,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
